<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-16T14:57:29.536Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:57:29 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen have intensified kidnappings of Catholic clergy in Benue, abducting Rev. Fr. John Otache and other priests while police launch rescue operations. At the same time, bandits seized a Kaduna couple and their six-month-old daughter, later releasing them after a ransom demand. Islamist fighters continued assaults on military targets, killing a traditional ruler in Plateau and prompting fears of soldier deaths after an attack on a Borno post. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPcFZtNFNEN2JfMWRJaVE3RTFYY21mdlFtYmNSM2pWRkdpRU5COVZ0Q2lFT3ZHUXRQd2tYU2o2b0VYMjFiRXBtZWhiU2cyZThLQ0kzVW1DNHFoNWlLNkZFMEs1TzVaQ1hfLUFJMENBa3VvVmxDTzZxSFA2QmhSV24weVZYWDhSQnc1Tmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOcVF3RUtRN2k0NG40WkFWUUQ1eFFuWEJZenZzM0lLWFRNNFNZWHZEdGg4MTZfQV9DZUtwSjQ1dE9LSzE2SjQ3V3F4RkdqQUpleHNtRGM1S216ZW9HYnJxSDJuUnJWRFF6SHliQWRqM0t0eTZaRVMwdzVsaG5RTzZuLVg1Q0l4a2FxN1FRUEVvUlJOeVFZS3JreGl1Z1hBZ1BxbjJCc3p6VnZSZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPTERJVzJUb3QzU3JpRjNLbUNpWmxqWmNDSUI0VlJDMU9NY0dpZnY4ZDZjRUcyX3lza0xuTlQ5am9WVXNWdEY2ZDZKaW5QeVM4d0s3VWRrdTF5a0ZBRzZ6NWROR0tpcHJxN3RYd1hhMGJmYzk3RjNRQUlFR3dtbndvNEM4OWZwa1ZBbjByRUt0bV9oU0NmZzJOU1MzTlR5QmM3WDJtUHhxYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eagle Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPRFRORXpMV0VGNjEwODNja3pLQVAzYm5RMC1NLTBDVTJZejdqNEdUXzQtVFZtekRhTEJUclU2dWdGSlBCU3ZMLTIxNmhqaC1tT3BkdE9NckJoamlsamIxWWozOWM0cnlvUlVNSWZTazdidGlzVE42VmZwM2hyMUQ5cHZfRTZUOXFNVkREeVRhU2NjQldpVkNYLTVPcHA5Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.